<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Adventure Park Challenge</title>

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://maxcdn.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/4.3.1/css/bootstrap.min.css">

  <style>
    /* Theme: Twilight Expedition - Midnight Blue, Coral Orange, and Cyan */
    body {
      background-color: #0b1329;
      color: #e2e8f0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px;
    }

    h1 {
      color: #ff6b4a; /* Coral Accent */
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    h2 {
      color: #38bdf8; /* Cyan Heading */
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    h3 {
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    small {
      color: #94a3b8;
    }

    dl {
      text-align: left;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    dt {
      color: #ff6b4a;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    dd {
      color: #cbd5e1;
    }

    mark {
      background-color: #ff6b4a;
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 2px 6px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    code {
      background-color: #1e293b;
      color: #38bdf8;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    abbr {
      color: #38bdf8;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: help;
    }

    pre {
      background-color: #1e293b;
      color: #38bdf8;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      display: inline-block;
      text-align: left;
      border: 1px solid #334155;
    }

    blockquote {
      border-left: 4px solid #ff6b4a;
      padding-left: 15px;
      color: #cbd5e1;
      font-style: italic;
      display: inline-block;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .blockquote-footer {
      color: #94a3b8;
    }

    hr {
      border-color: #1e293b;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <h1>Adventure Park Challenge</h1>
  <p>Master park typography elements while discovering thrilling attraction zones and safety protocols.</p>

  <hr>

  <h2>Explorer Levels</h2>
  <p class="display-1">Apex Voyager</p>
  <p class="display-2">Peak Climber</p>
  <p class="display-3">Forest Ranger</p>
  <p class="display-4">Rookie Pathfinder</p>

  <hr>

  <h2>Registered Adventurers</h2>
  <h3>Liam <small>Pass Level: Apex Voyager</small></h3>
  <h3>Sophia <small>Pass Level: Peak Climber</small></h3>
  <h3>Ethan <small>Pass Level: Forest Ranger</small></h3>

  <hr>

  <h2>Safety Briefing & Checklist</h2>
  <p>All visitors must gather at <mark>Checkpoint Alpha</mark> prior to launch.</p>
  <p>The emergency assembly area is located at <mark>Summit Base</mark>.</p>

  <hr>

  <h2>Attraction Glossary</h2>
  <dl>
    <dt>Giga Zip Line</dt>
    <dd>A high-speed aerial cable ride descending across the central canyon.</dd>

    <dt>Boulder Run</dt>
    <dd>An obstacle-filled climbing track designed for team navigation.</dd>

    <dt>Thunder Rapids</dt>
    <dd>An intense white-water rafting simulator along artificial river surges.</dd>
  </dl>

  <hr>

  <h2>System Terminal Commands</h2>
  <p>Initialize zip cable: <code>launch.deploy("Giga Zip Line")</code></p>
  <p>Unlock obstacle gate: <code>gate.access("Boulder Run")</code></p>
  <p>Halt water pumps: <code>system.pause("Thunder Rapids")</code></p>

  <hr>

  <h2>Park Organization Codes</h2>
  <p><abbr title="Adventure Park Operations Center">APOC</abbr> monitors real-time ride safety metrics.</p>
  <p><abbr title="Emergency Medical Response Unit">EMRU</abbr> stations paramedics throughout every challenge zone.</p>
  <p><abbr title="Young Explorers Federation">YEF</abbr> conducts guided tours for junior participants.</p>

  <hr>

  <h2>Official Expedition Itinerary</h2>
  <pre>
09:30 AM  -  Check-In & Gear Allocation
10:30 AM  -  Giga Zip Line Challenge
12:30 PM  -  Boulder Run Navigation
02:30 PM  -  Thunder Rapids Run
04:00 PM  -  Badging Ceremony
  </pre>

  <hr>

  <h2>Park Philosophy</h2>
  <blockquote class="blockquote">
    <p>"Courage is not the absence of fear, but the triumph over it."</p>
    <footer class="blockquote-footer">Adventure Park Leadership</footer>
  </blockquote>

</body>

</html>